# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build context for the caller-agent image (see code/caller-agent/Dockerfile).
# Build context is `code/` so the Dockerfile can reach `shared/`.
# Allowlist only what caller-agent's build needs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Ignore everything by default
**

# --- Folders the caller-agent build needs ---
!caller-agent/
!caller-agent/**
!shared/
!shared/**

# --- Re-exclude junk inside allowed folders ---
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/Properties/launchSettings.json
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
